====Inflection====
* Like with {{m|fi|kuka}}, there are two inflectional paradigms, and modern Finnish uses a mixture of the two; the nominative singular uses the stem {{m|fi||ku-}} and all other forms use the stem {{m|fi||kene-}}. The other forms, shown with parentheses in the table below, are considered old-fashioned. See {{m|fi|kuka}} for more information.
* The inflectional ending comes before the clitic {{m|fi||-(ka)an}}.

